OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see scattered showers. Becoming
OL,7,Fdrier overnight with showers becoming
OL,8,Fconfined to the far northwest. Strong
OL,9,Fsouth or southwesterly winds in the
OL,10,Fnorthwest, some coastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy, will spread northeast during
OL,14,Fthe morning. Drier and clearer weather
OL,15,Fwill spread from the west by evening,
OL,16,Fthough with still a few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
