OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers in the northwest on Monday,
OL,7,Fmainly dry in the east. Windy and
OL,8,Fmainly dry on Tuesday, rain spreading
OL,9,Feast later. Bright with showers
OL,10,FWednesday.
